OL,3,GNEWSALancaster cockpit created by 'mad
OL,4,Agenius' goes on display
OL,5,
OL,6,FDescribed by his family as a "mad
OL,7,Fgenius", Leon Ellison spent decades
OL,8,Fcrafting a close replica of a Lancaster
OL,9,Fbomber's cockpit in his garden
OL,10,Fworkshop.
OL,12,FLeon died in 2024.
OL,14,FHis dying wish was for his work to be
OL,15,Fgifted to Metheringham Airfield Visitor
OL,16,FCentre in Lincolnshire.
OL,18,FOn Thursday, it arrived at its new
OL,19,Fhome, witnessed by his son, Adrian, 57.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
